  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Growing up on Street Yay Blvd taught Ducky 'Rust Bill' Riot to hustle for every scrap of DRIP. He witnessed firsthand how quickly fortunes could turn in Subchain City, and he vowed to become a player, not a pawn, in this pixelated apocalypse. After his flock was wiped out by the Glitch Goblins, he's been a lone wolf, trading secrets and salvaged tech to survive.",
